  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{Na}_{2} \\mathrm{~S}_{4} \\mathrm{O}_{6}$\r\n\r\n$2+4 x-12=0$\r\n\r\n$4 x-10=0$\r\n\r\n$x=\\frac{10}{4}=\\frac{+5}{2}$\r\n\r\nOxidation state of $\\mathrm{S}$ is $=\\frac{+5}{2}$"
